<title>SINGAPORE: Hongkong Land jumps 20 pct in early trade.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Land jumps 20 pct in early trade.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd shares jumped in early dealings by about 20 percent on rumours Hong Kong tycoon Li Ka Shing was buying into the company, dealers said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
